# CLIENT PII PROTECTION:
# Every per-site business dossier is websites/<site>/README.md (emails, phones,
# owner names, addresses live ONLY there). This scoped rule blocks exactly those
# dossiers. The repo ROOT README.md and any skills/*/README.md stay tracked and
# keep updating normally. Site folders' other artifacts (audit.md/pdf, Outreach,
# Evidence, data/) ARE pushed as progress backup — ONLY after a PII scan passes
# (raw data/*.json captures can still contain page-text phones — scrub before push).
websites/*/README.md
